{"nodes": [{"id": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "label": "Multi-Guild Migration Plan (MEE6-level)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Approved source of truth for migrating the Cheterin bot + dashboard from single-guild to multi-guild operation; implementation not started. Main guild ID 1324239354154975252."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_manage_server_access_model", "label": "Manage Server Access Model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dashboard access per guild is granted by Discord Manage Server / Administrator permission (MEE6 model) instead of .env role lists; DASHBOARD_ACCESS_ROLE_IDS is removed. Server-side re-verification via resolve_guild_member because the OAuth guild list alone is not trusted."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_settings_db", "label": "Unified settings.db Per-Guild Storage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single SQLite table module_settings(guild_id, module, json, updated_at) with WAL and busy_timeout replaces ~10 flat JSON configs and all load_config/save_config in *_core.py. mtime-cache pattern replaced by in-memory {(guild_id, module): data} cache invalidated on put. One-time startup migration writes existing flat configs under guild_id=1324239354154975252 and renames files to *.migrated.bak."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_two_level_language_model", "label": "Two-Level Language Model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UI language is a personal user choice (header button, localStorage) while bot message language is a per-server setting stored in settings.db \u2014 two independent levels so a user's dashboard language never affects other members' bot messages."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_main_guild_id", "label": "MAIN_GUILD_ID Constant", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MAIN_GUILD_ID = 1324239354154975252 (env, constant in access.py) is kept only for CTD, news relay, and super-admin checks after the mandatory GUILD_ID is removed from main.py."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_phase1_text_cleanup", "label": "Phase 1: Text Cleanup and Explicit Limits", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-breaking first phase: remove 'imported from another bot' wording on dashboard pages, surface validation limits (sourced from routes/*.py) next to inputs, and delete superadmin/developers sections from public Docs.tsx."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_guild_dimension_migration", "label": "Phase 2.2: Guild Dimension for Module Data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds guild_id to stats.db tables (xp_members PK becomes (guild_id, user_id), voice_sessions and audit_log get guild_id, existing rows assigned to guild 404) and moves all flat data JSON files (events, brackets, reaction_roles, giveaways, supply, voice_panel, serverlog, streams, etc.) into settings.db per-guild; xp_card_bg.png becomes card_bg/<guild_id>.png. DBs that already have guild_id (mafia/bunker/warns/private_rooms/family) get every query audited for guild filtering."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_oauth_guilds_flow", "label": "Phase 2.3: OAuth Guilds Scope and Server Selection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "OAuth scope becomes 'identify guilds' with tokens stored in the encrypted cookie session; callback no longer checks single-guild membership and redirects to /servers. New endpoints: GET /api/auth/guilds (filtered by MANAGE_GUILD|ADMINISTRATOR, has_bot flag, 60s cache for Discord rate limits), POST /api/auth/select-guild (server-side permission re-check, writes session active_guild_id), GET /api/auth/invite-url. ~25 route files switch from app[guild_id] to request[guild_id]. Risk: all dashboard users must re-login after the scope change."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_bot_global_sync", "label": "Phase 2.4: Bot Detached from GUILD_ID", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "main.py drops mandatory GUILD_ID, copy_global_to and clear_commands in favor of global tree.sync() (plus one-time cleanup of old guild commands; global commands take up to 1 hour to propagate). Every cog reads settings by the event's guild_id; schedulers (daily_topic, giveaways, tempban, supply, family birthdays) loop over all guilds with the module enabled via settings.db query or bot.guilds. on_guild_join sends a dashboard link; on_guild_remove marks settings inactive instead of deleting."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_ctd_main_guild_gate", "label": "CTD Main-Guild Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CTD cog (memobb.py, CTD_ROLE_ID/CTD_CHANNEL_ID in config.json) becomes active only when guild.id == MAIN_GUILD_ID; its dashboard settings page is visible only with the main server selected, and CTD keys leave the shared config route."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_news_relay_superadmin", "label": "News Relay as Super-Admin Feature", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "News relay (news.py + news_relay.json) moves from the shared menu into the super-admin section; it may listen to sources on any guild but validates that publish targets belong to the main guild only. news_relay.json migrates into settings.db under the main guild_id."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_superadmin_main_check", "label": "Super-Admin Check Against Main Guild", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Super-admin remains the hardcoded role 1505359848433516734, but after migration the check is always resolved against MAIN_GUILD_ID regardless of the currently selected server."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_i18n_infrastructure", "label": "Phase 3: RU/EN i18n Infrastructure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately lightweight hand-rolled i18n: frontend dictionaries src/i18n/ru.ts and en.ts with useT() hook and LanguageProvider (no heavy libraries); backend i18n.py with t(key, lang, **fmt) and locales/ru.py, locales/en.py. Server language stored as settings.db (guild_id, 'language') with default ru; public game pages use the game server's language."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_slash_command_localization", "label": "Slash Command Localization", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Base command names switch to English (/bunker-game, /mafia-game, /giveaway) with Russian provided via name_localizations/description_localizations (discord.app_commands.locale_str). Renaming base names creates new commands for users, so it must be announced in advance."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_bunker_cards_bilingual", "label": "Bilingual Bunker Game Cards", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every record in bunker_data.py gains name_en (and effect_en/description_en where present); character generation stores both languages in the card so display can follow the server language at render time."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_phase4_scalability", "label": "Phase 4: Load and Resilience (MEE6 Level)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AutoShardedBot enabled early (Discord requires sharding ~2500 guilds), chunk_guilds_at_startup=False with minimal member_cache_flags and on-demand guild.chunk()/fetch; SQLite WAL + single-writer everywhere with a Postgres transition point at ~500+ active guilds (access layer designed so the swap is local); rate-limit queues for mass operations; bot verification and privileged-intent approval required at 75+ guilds; health metrics in super-admin panel."}, {"id": "multiguild_plan_xp_global_to_main_migration", "label": "XP Global-to-Main Migration Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "XP is currently global (stats.db xp_members has PK user_id with no guild_id); during migration all existing XP is assigned to the main guild (agreed default) and other guilds start from zero. Every DB migration is preceded by an automatic *.bak-<date> backup and must be idempotent, following the bunker_db PRAGMA-migration pattern."}, {"id": "main_chetbot", "label": "main.py ChetBot", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "dashboard_backend_auth_callback", "label": "OAuth Callback Handler", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "dashboard_backend_access_require_dashboard_access", "label": "require_dashboard_access Middleware", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "stats_db_xp_members", "label": "stats.db xp_members Table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "stats_db_voice_sessions", "label": "stats.db voice_sessions Table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "stats_db_audit_log", "label": "stats.db audit_log Table", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bunker_core_get_settings", "label": "bunker_core.get_settings", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "memobb_ctd", "label": "memobb.py CTD Cog", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "news_relay", "label": "news.py News Relay", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_phase1_text_cleanup", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_settings_db", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_guild_dimension_migration", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_oauth_guilds_flow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_bot_global_sync", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_ctd_main_guild_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_news_relay_superadmin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MULTIGUILD_PLAN.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "multiguild_plan_migration_plan", "target": "multiguild_plan_i18n_infrastructure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file"